# Canon CIO Command Center - Environment Variables
# ====================================================
# No environment variables are required for the MVP.
# All configuration is defined in code (src/config/).
#
# This file is a placeholder for future phases when
# API endpoints, feature flags, or external services
# may require environment-specific configuration.
#
# Usage:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Future variables (not yet active):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
# VITE_ENABLE_ANALYTICS=false
# VITE_FEATURE_FLAG_ADVANCED_CHARTS=false